(5528770, 798986, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably considered more "in color" than "toned" but hey, it''s quite lovely and it is in two "tones" - green and black, I''d wager.  And it''s very lovely.  Excellent DOF to get clarity on the drops and good detail.  Very gentle, calming photograph.</td>', 'Probably considered more "in color" than "toned" but hey, it''s quite lovely and it is in two "tones" - green and black, I''d wager.  And it''s very lovely.  Excellent DOF to get clarity on the drops and good detail.  Very gentle, calming photograph.', '2009-06-15 07:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528772, 799255, 30982, '<td valign="top">An odd yet intriguing composition.  Gotta love those trapezoids of light.  But why is she sitting there, staring blankly at the wall?  It''s always good to have a photograph that makes people wonder and explore.</td>', 'An odd yet intriguing composition.  Gotta love those trapezoids of light.  But why is she sitting there, staring blankly at the wall?  It''s always good to have a photograph that makes people wonder and explore.', '2009-06-15 07:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
