(5529226, 799303, 100773, '<td valign="top">Christ this is an interesting photo! So many different stories! I especially liked the guy with the backback standing in front of the counter in the middle (or whatever it is). Everyones running around in their stressfull life, but he just stands there, looking like he''s observing a map to figure out where the hell he is. Loved it!</td>', 'Christ this is an interesting photo! So many different stories! I especially liked the guy with the backback standing in front of the counter in the middle (or whatever it is). Everyones running around in their stressfull life, but he just stands there, looking like he''s observing a map to figure out where the hell he is. Loved it!', '2009-06-15 12:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529228, 799078, 33361, '<td valign="top">geeez I love this.. hope it doesn''t get disqualified because it''s art</td>', 'geeez I love this.. hope it doesn''t get disqualified because it''s art', '2009-06-15 12:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
