(5529235, 799425, 33361, '<td valign="top">wow - there are so many things I LOVE about this image.. the arms open to the universe, the cross feature of the sidewalk and the tones work well because she''s a little girl. 9</td>', 'wow - there are so many things I LOVE about this image.. the arms open to the universe, the cross feature of the sidewalk and the tones work well because she''s a little girl. 9', '2009-06-15 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529239, 799033, 33361, '<td valign="top">nice! 8</td>', 'nice! 8', '2009-06-15 12:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529240, 797836, 100773, '<td valign="top">Maybe you should''ve left the sky out of this photo as the slow shutter made the bright part of the sky overexposed. Cropped it or framing it otherwise would''ve prevented that. It could also have been sharper, and I think the tones of this picture would benefit from increasing the contrast. But it is duotones! And your idea is good, so keep it up!</td>', 'Maybe you should''ve left the sky out of this photo as the slow shutter made the bright part of the sky overexposed. Cropped it or framing it otherwise would''ve prevented that. It could also have been sharper, and I think the tones of this picture would benefit from increasing the contrast. But it is duotones! And your idea is good, so keep it up!', '2009-06-15 12:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529244, 799038, 33361, '<td valign="top">I love the lines in the hand and the light little drops. Nice toning! 8</td>', 'I love the lines in the hand and the light little drops. Nice toning! 8', '2009-06-15 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
