(5529310, 799334, 24454, '<td valign="top">How GLORIOUS!  My guess is this is doing really well.  These types of photos are always such a big hit.  As they should be!  The detail in the rugged rocks contrasting that dreamy water is breathtaking.</td>', 'How GLORIOUS!  My guess is this is doing really well.  These types of photos are always such a big hit.  As they should be!  The detail in the rugged rocks contrasting that dreamy water is breathtaking.', '2009-06-15 13:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529311, 797932, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit freaky looking at this. I''m pretty sure that there''s two walls, and not one. Another angle, if possible, wouldn''t be so disturbing. Wondering what kind of a lens you used on this, or where you stood taking this. Obviously kinda hard changing the angle if you shoot from a window. Downwards and up, capturing the two walls with the sky above would make a more interesting picture. MY OPPINION THAT IS! FREAKY walls you have captured =D</td>', 'It''s a bit freaky looking at this. I''m pretty sure that there''s two walls, and not one. Another angle, if possible, wouldn''t be so disturbing. Wondering what kind of a lens you used on this, or where you stood taking this. Obviously kinda hard changing the angle if you shoot from a window. Downwards and up, capturing the two walls with the sky above would make a more interesting picture. MY OPPINION THAT IS! FREAKY walls you have captured =D', '2009-06-15 13:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
