(5529416, 798904, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is really, really well done..but you have a haziness that is hanging in the middle of your shot...did you do a gradient...I really think that would have improved that area...your water is so very richly toned as you sky is...but the center of the picture (mountains) is quite hazy</td>', 'this is really, really well done..but you have a haziness that is hanging in the middle of your shot...did you do a gradient...I really think that would have improved that area...your water is so very richly toned as you sky is...but the center of the picture (mountains) is quite hazy', '2009-06-15 13:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529418, 798953, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much enjoy the barely there trees on the left side.  Lovely sense of scale, of peace, of beauty in this.</td>', 'I very much enjoy the barely there trees on the left side.  Lovely sense of scale, of peace, of beauty in this.', '2009-06-15 13:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
