(5529832, 798958, 30982, '<td valign="top">I did a quick run-through of the challenge.  This was the one that caught my eye immediately.  I suspect this is Nick.  It takes cajones to attempt to re-create something from a master - this is a very, very fine recreation.  I''ll go ahead and give you a 10 now, then make sure I vote the rest of the challenge so it sticks.  A feast for the eyes.  LOL!  I''m a dork - I didn''t even see the title until now.  Oh, and I like the trash.</td>', 'I did a quick run-through of the challenge.  This was the one that caught my eye immediately.  I suspect this is Nick.  It takes cajones to attempt to re-create something from a master - this is a very, very fine recreation.  I''ll go ahead and give you a 10 now, then make sure I vote the rest of the challenge so it sticks.  A feast for the eyes.  LOL!  I''m a dork - I didn''t even see the title until now.  Oh, and I like the trash.', '2009-06-15 16:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529836, 799314, 30982, '<td valign="top">A fine mood, exquisite texture and lighting, and positively delicious perspective.  Little boy lost and no where to go at the end of the stairs.  No where at the top either, from what you''ve given us.  Excellent B&amp;W conversion.  If I were a betting woman, I''d say that''s a young Too on the steps.  Definitely a departure, and an excellent one, from some of your other work.  Bordering on nixter-esque.</td>', 'A fine mood, exquisite texture and lighting, and positively delicious perspective.  Little boy lost and no where to go at the end of the stairs.  No where at the top either, from what you''ve given us.  Excellent B&W conversion.  If I were a betting woman, I''d say that''s a young Too on the steps.  Definitely a departure, and an excellent one, from some of your other work.  Bordering on nixter-esque.', '2009-06-15 16:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529837, 799179, 88247, '<td valign="top">Magical.<br/>A place where dreams come true:-)</td>', 'Magical.A place where dreams come true:-)', '2009-06-15 16:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
