(5529847, 798617, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent minimalism and the light across the wing is perfect.  The toning really suits this well - peaceful, powerful.</td>', 'Excellent minimalism and the light across the wing is perfect.  The toning really suits this well - peaceful, powerful.', '2009-06-15 16:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
