(5529856, 799134, 30982, '<td valign="top">This shows great care and precision in this person''s art.  Very lovingly done.</td>', 'This shows great care and precision in this person''s art.  Very lovingly done.', '2009-06-15 16:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529858, 798172, 30982, '<td valign="top">Buy!!  Love the wide angle here, and the bold vibrant blue works very well!</td>', 'Buy!!  Love the wide angle here, and the bold vibrant blue works very well!', '2009-06-15 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529860, 799038, 30982, '<td valign="top">Classic and very nicely done.</td>', 'Classic and very nicely done.', '2009-06-15 16:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529861, 799033, 88247, '<td valign="top">"LIFE"<br/>Where there''s life there is hope and always new beginnings!!<br/>I love this shot.<br/>It is so meaningful:-)</td>', '"LIFE"Where there''s life there is hope and always new beginnings!!I love this shot.It is so meaningful:-)', '2009-06-15 16:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529862, 798880, 30982, '<td valign="top">SandyP?  Has her signature grace, softness (yet perfectly sharp) and elegance.  Lovely composition, and makes me want to reach out and pet that fur!  (But I won''t - I want to keep my hand, thanks.)</td>', 'SandyP?  Has her signature grace, softness (yet perfectly sharp) and elegance.  Lovely composition, and makes me want to reach out and pet that fur!  (But I won''t - I want to keep my hand, thanks.)', '2009-06-15 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529864, 799263, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite like the lights in this.  Classic view, nicely done.</td>', 'Quite like the lights in this.  Classic view, nicely done.', '2009-06-15 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529867, 799078, 30982, '<td valign="top">Portrait of a woman, reclining.  Quite intriguing!</td>', 'Portrait of a woman, reclining.  Quite intriguing!', '2009-06-15 17:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529869, 799245, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clean - memories of a sunny day at the beach without the pesky sand getting everywhere.</td>', 'Very crisp and clean - memories of a sunny day at the beach without the pesky sand getting everywhere.', '2009-06-15 17:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529871, 798382, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful softness and tones - quite fitting for your young model!</td>', 'Beautiful softness and tones - quite fitting for your young model!', '2009-06-15 17:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529872, 799246, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang.  Very arresting.  Nice portrait!</td>', 'Dang.  Very arresting.  Nice portrait!', '2009-06-15 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529874, 799436, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this.</td>', 'I quite like this.', '2009-06-15 17:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529875, 799156, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very fun!  I like the processing, too.</td>', 'Very fun!  I like the processing, too.', '2009-06-15 17:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529876, 797977, 30982, '<td valign="top">The metallic tones are quite striking!</td>', 'The metallic tones are quite striking!', '2009-06-15 17:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529879, 797817, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait with a natural feel to it - the toning really suits this well.</td>', 'Very good portrait with a natural feel to it - the toning really suits this well.', '2009-06-15 17:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529881, 798355, 30982, '<td valign="top">Rendered almost mythically!</td>', 'Rendered almost mythically!', '2009-06-15 17:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529882, 798803, 30982, '<td valign="top">Such a magestic place.  Toning is excellent for this.</td>', 'Such a magestic place.  Toning is excellent for this.', '2009-06-15 17:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529884, 799135, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very professional, very alluring.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Very professional, very alluring.  Excellent work.', '2009-06-15 17:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529907, 798880, 88247, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous shot And,Such great detail.<br/>I love the watchful gaze.<br/>This is My fav of favs in this challenge!!<br/>Good Luck:-)</td>', 'What a fabulous shot And,Such great detail.I love the watchful gaze.This is My fav of favs in this challenge!!Good Luck:-)', '2009-06-15 17:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529914, 799334, 88247, '<td valign="top">Very calming.<br/>There is something about this shot that keeps drawing me back to it!!<br/>I really like the setting.<br/>It makes me want to sit on one of those rocks and dangle my feet in the water:-)</td>', 'Very calming.There is something about this shot that keeps drawing me back to it!!I really like the setting.It makes me want to sit on one of those rocks and dangle my feet in the water:-)', '2009-06-15 17:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529918, 799275, 88247, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot:-)</td>', 'What a beautiful shot:-)', '2009-06-15 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5529919, 799018, 88247, '<td valign="top">Awesome:-)<br/>A lovely shot.</td>', 'Awesome:-)A lovely shot.', '2009-06-15 17:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530015, 797821, 35804, '<td valign="top">I am longing for the texture of the feathers that I know is there but has perhaps been lost in a noise reduction application? I do find the composition very appealing though.<br/> <br/>I just got your PM. Regardless of whether you actually used a noise reduction program or not, to my eye it looks like you have. There is an unnatural softness about the feathers. If you have done minimal editing as you said in your PM, perhaps you did a good deal of cropping to arrive at this composition. I saw in the score tracking thread your score is in the 4.6 area and you seem really frustrated. Score has nothing to do with how good you are as a photographer. A vote is an opinion. I get horrible scores all the time. The average DPC voter is very technically minded, and this does have what appears to be some technical issues. I''m not one to harp on that sort of thing, I embrace all things blurry, soft...expressive. But something about this photograph does seem unnatural in the lack of detail...it has that plasticy melty look of overzealous NR application whether you used it or not. For what it''s worth, I''ve scored this a 5 because I <i>do</i> enjoy the composition very much.</td>', 'I am longing for the texture of the feathers that I know is there but has perhaps been lost in a noise reduction application? I do find the composition very appealing though. I just got your PM. Regardless of whether you actually used a noise reduction program or not, to my eye it looks like you have. There is an unnatural softness about the feathers. If you have done minimal editing as you said in your PM, perhaps you did a good deal of cropping to arrive at this composition. I saw in the score tracking thread your score is in the 4.6 area and you seem really frustrated. Score has nothing to do with how good you are as a photographer. A vote is an opinion. I get horrible scores all the time. The average DPC voter is very technically minded, and this does have what appears to be some technical issues. I''m not one to harp on that sort of thing, I embrace all things blurry, soft...expressive. But something about this photograph does seem unnatural in the lack of detail...it has that plasticy melty look of overzealous NR application whether you used it or not. For what it''s worth, I''ve scored this a 5 because I do enjoy the composition very much.', '2009-06-15 18:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530029, 799345, 43555, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2009-06-15 18:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530033, 799432, 65234, '<td valign="top">Probably not to everyone''s taste. but I rather like it.  The light on the wings brings out a surprising amount of detail for something in motion.  And it does look like the butterfly''s creating a breeze in its wake.  The beginnings of a catastrophic storm, no doubt ;-)</td>', 'Probably not to everyone''s taste. but I rather like it.  The light on the wings brings out a surprising amount of detail for something in motion.  And it does look like the butterfly''s creating a breeze in its wake.  The beginnings of a catastrophic storm, no doubt ;-)', '2009-06-15 18:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530038, 799018, 65234, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Great Falls on the Potomac River.  Nice tonal range.</td>', 'Reminds me of Great Falls on the Potomac River.  Nice tonal range.', '2009-06-15 18:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530064, 799430, 14867, '<td valign="top">In spite of a beautiful sky, it''s a bit flat: a less centered tree and more of the valley on left side should help IMO</td>', 'In spite of a beautiful sky, it''s a bit flat: a less centered tree and more of the valley on left side should help IMO', '2009-06-15 18:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530068, 799107, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good...but too much elements (plant, lamp, wires...) breaking and spoiling what should stay a purely graphic image.</td>', 'Good...but too much elements (plant, lamp, wires...) breaking and spoiling what should stay a purely graphic image.', '2009-06-15 18:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530072, 799374, 98647, '<td valign="top">Nicely processed. I like the contrast of the light vs. the dark on the 2 parts of the building.</td>', 'Nicely processed. I like the contrast of the light vs. the dark on the 2 parts of the building.', '2009-06-15 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530073, 799310, 14867, '<td valign="top">Elegant work</td>', 'Elegant work', '2009-06-15 18:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530078, 799314, 98647, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Good contrast and details in the walls.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Good contrast and details in the walls.', '2009-06-15 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530082, 799425, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this enchanting photo!</td>', 'I love this enchanting photo!', '2009-06-15 18:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530084, 798268, 98647, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh. The black line going to the left balances the composition nicely.</td>', 'Good bokeh. The black line going to the left balances the composition nicely.', '2009-06-15 18:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530086, 799447, 14867, '<td valign="top">Not exactly what I expected as duotone (black, white an blue), but why not? More distracting: the very poor processing on the line between the hills and the sky</td>', 'Not exactly what I expected as duotone (black, white an blue), but why not? More distracting: the very poor processing on the line between the hills and the sky', '2009-06-15 18:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530090, 799283, 98647, '<td valign="top">Love the colour you chose for the toning.</td>', 'Love the colour you chose for the toning.', '2009-06-15 18:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530101, 799297, 65234, '<td valign="top">Riduculously adorable face!</td>', 'Riduculously adorable face!', '2009-06-15 18:50:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5530103, 798867, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail on the ''shrooms, and sort of a spooky feel to the whole thing which is intriguing.</td>', 'Very nice detail on the ''shrooms, and sort of a spooky feel to the whole thing which is intriguing.', '2009-06-15 18:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530105, 799452, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and detail on the bee, with just a hint of motion blur in the wings.  I kind of want more of the flower in focus, though, just because it takes up so much of the image.</td>', 'Nice focus and detail on the bee, with just a hint of motion blur in the wings.  I kind of want more of the flower in focus, though, just because it takes up so much of the image.', '2009-06-15 18:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530106, 798707, 65234, '<td valign="top">All the darkness is interesting, like there are hideous things lurking there and the calm is deceptive.</td>', 'All the darkness is interesting, like there are hideous things lurking there and the calm is deceptive.', '2009-06-15 18:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530108, 797836, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range for a gloomy day!</td>', 'Nice tonal range for a gloomy day!', '2009-06-15 18:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530110, 798781, 65234, '<td valign="top">That does not look sufficiently controlled for a flaming object!  Excellent detail on the flame, I must say.</td>', 'That does not look sufficiently controlled for a flaming object!  Excellent detail on the flame, I must say.', '2009-06-15 18:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530112, 799133, 98647, '<td valign="top">I love the edginess of this shot. I just wish the background wasn''t harsh white.</td>', 'I love the edginess of this shot. I just wish the background wasn''t harsh white.', '2009-06-15 18:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530114, 799079, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''m in love :-)  Marvelous capture of the feel of the place, without losing too much detail.</td>', 'Wow.  I''m in love :-)  Marvelous capture of the feel of the place, without losing too much detail.', '2009-06-15 18:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530116, 799326, 98647, '<td valign="top">Well done on the processing. Good details on the petals.</td>', 'Well done on the processing. Good details on the petals.', '2009-06-15 18:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530118, 798617, 98647, '<td valign="top">Very simple but also very impactful.</td>', 'Very simple but also very impactful.', '2009-06-15 18:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530120, 798741, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rather unusual wing position, like he was testing the wind before taking off.  Looks a little cartoonish around the edges to me but still an interesting image.</td>', 'Rather unusual wing position, like he was testing the wind before taking off.  Looks a little cartoonish around the edges to me but still an interesting image.', '2009-06-15 18:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530121, 799309, 65234, '<td valign="top">Talk about doom and gloom!  The body language says despair and everything else (color, tones, mist) reinforces it.</td>', 'Talk about doom and gloom!  The body language says despair and everything else (color, tones, mist) reinforces it.', '2009-06-15 18:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530125, 799149, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the bottom 2/3 of your shot. The white area in the middle of the sky kills that part of the shot for me. Also, I wouldn''t have cropped so close on the right side.</td>', 'I like the bottom 2/3 of your shot. The white area in the middle of the sky kills that part of the shot for me. Also, I wouldn''t have cropped so close on the right side.', '2009-06-15 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530131, 799225, 98647, '<td valign="top">The expressions on their faces are priceless!  They are in their own world. The blur also lends to that feeling. Good job.</td>', 'The expressions on their faces are priceless!  They are in their own world. The blur also lends to that feeling. Good job.', '2009-06-15 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530143, 799354, 63152, '<td valign="top">For me the contrast is way too high. The over all effect is like a badly scanned ink drawing. This is both in the boots and in the stockings. Those pixels where the colour goes into full black really stand out and not in a good way.<br/> <br/>I know your processing of the photo was clearly done with a purpose in mind but the overall result I see is a graphic element rather than a photo. It''s a fine line to tread and I think you went on the wrong side of it this time around.<br/> <br/>The pose of the legs is good though.</td>', 'For me the contrast is way too high. The over all effect is like a badly scanned ink drawing. This is both in the boots and in the stockings. Those pixels where the colour goes into full black really stand out and not in a good way. I know your processing of the photo was clearly done with a purpose in mind but the overall result I see is a graphic element rather than a photo. It''s a fine line to tread and I think you went on the wrong side of it this time around. The pose of the legs is good though.', '2009-06-15 19:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530146, 799145, 63152, '<td valign="top">The image has been processed to be almost like a line drawing rather than a photo. I er.. yeah, I can''t say I like it.</td>', 'The image has been processed to be almost like a line drawing rather than a photo. I er.. yeah, I can''t say I like it.', '2009-06-15 19:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530180, 798702, 92296, '<td valign="top">Don''t normally go for horse shots, but this is a great portrait. 7</td>', 'Don''t normally go for horse shots, but this is a great portrait. 7', '2009-06-15 20:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530182, 799149, 92296, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, framing and dof. 7</td>', 'Very nice capture, framing and dof. 7', '2009-06-15 20:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530231, 799214, 34659, '<td valign="top">This would have been a 10 if not for the editing artifacts above/around the bush on the right.  Looks like you forgot to smooth out the edge when you cut around it.  Still...  Beautiful tonal range and composition.</td>', 'This would have been a 10 if not for the editing artifacts above/around the bush on the right.  Looks like you forgot to smooth out the edge when you cut around it.  Still...  Beautiful tonal range and composition.', '2009-06-15 20:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530250, 798986, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wonderful rich tones!</td>', 'Wonderful rich tones!', '2009-06-15 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530260, 797905, 98339, '<td valign="top">this looks like a really cool Merry-Go-Round...it is only covered now because it is to early in the season...I hope so...my first impression is that your shot is a little to "centered" for me...you tone is good as is you focus, might have cloned out the car on the far left (that is being picky...)</td>', 'this looks like a really cool Merry-Go-Round...it is only covered now because it is to early in the season...I hope so...my first impression is that your shot is a little to "centered" for me...you tone is good as is you focus, might have cloned out the car on the far left (that is being picky...)', '2009-06-15 20:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530263, 799432, 98339, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I think about this...I guess I need more explanation why it is so blurred, but I will have to wait until later for the PPN''s on this</td>', 'I''m not sure what I think about this...I guess I need more explanation why it is so blurred, but I will have to wait until later for the PPN''s on this', '2009-06-15 20:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530267, 799308, 74911, '<td valign="top">I like the lower half of the horizon... but there is something wrong with the clouds (may be the processing)</td>', 'I like the lower half of the horizon... but there is something wrong with the clouds (may be the processing)', '2009-06-15 20:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530270, 798354, 99311, '<td valign="top">The tones are good but it looks a bit overexposed to me.</td>', 'The tones are good but it looks a bit overexposed to me.', '2009-06-15 20:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530271, 799422, 98339, '<td valign="top">it seems that your focus is just a little soft to me, I would score higher if the eyes and nose were nice and sharp in focus</td>', 'it seems that your focus is just a little soft to me, I would score higher if the eyes and nose were nice and sharp in focus', '2009-06-15 20:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530274, 799149, 99311, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Due to lack of contrast from the background it is not having the desired effect.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Due to lack of contrast from the background it is not having the desired effect.', '2009-06-15 20:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530275, 798253, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, to me this is way to "centered" for the picture...almost dead center...I like your background and foreground</td>', 'ok, to me this is way to "centered" for the picture...almost dead center...I like your background and foreground', '2009-06-15 20:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530278, 799309, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is a truly interesting shot...it looks 3rd world...really well done...</td>', 'this is a truly interesting shot...it looks 3rd world...really well done...', '2009-06-15 20:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530279, 798810, 98339, '<td valign="top">I can see your tone for sure...your shot isn''t straight B&amp;W...well done</td>', 'I can see your tone for sure...your shot isn''t straight B&W...well done', '2009-06-15 21:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530281, 797888, 99311, '<td valign="top">I like the image. The foreground leaves are well exposed and sharp. The mountain and the clouds draw the eyes to the end of the picture. The contrast and balance of the overall picture makes it stand out.</td>', 'I like the image. The foreground leaves are well exposed and sharp. The mountain and the clouds draw the eyes to the end of the picture. The contrast and balance of the overall picture makes it stand out.', '2009-06-15 21:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530283, 799333, 99311, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture and post processing of the picture is great.</td>', 'Very nice picture and post processing of the picture is great.', '2009-06-15 21:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530284, 799278, 98339, '<td valign="top">I think this is actually a plant and not a flower...right, was your back drop dirty/dusty? or is that your lens? over all I like your focus and placement to the left...</td>', 'I think this is actually a plant and not a flower...right, was your back drop dirty/dusty? or is that your lens? over all I like your focus and placement to the left...', '2009-06-15 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530288, 798803, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful capture...but it does seem a bit bright...your detail and focus is excellent</td>', 'this is a wonderful capture...but it does seem a bit bright...your detail and focus is excellent', '2009-06-15 21:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530290, 798994, 93756, '<td valign="top">Looks like I''m inside his dream. Very cool shot and good desaturated colors.</td>', 'Looks like I''m inside his dream. Very cool shot and good desaturated colors.', '2009-06-15 21:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530291, 799173, 93756, '<td valign="top">Love your color choice and sense of humor.</td>', 'Love your color choice and sense of humor.', '2009-06-15 21:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530293, 799430, 98339, '<td valign="top">though your tone looks good, you lost some of your lighting...it seems quite dark to me</td>', 'though your tone looks good, you lost some of your lighting...it seems quite dark to me', '2009-06-15 21:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530297, 798948, 98339, '<td valign="top">excellent tones...and really good focus, well done</td>', 'excellent tones...and really good focus, well done', '2009-06-15 21:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530311, 799265, 98339, '<td valign="top">this defiantly works for the challenge, really great angles and lines</td>', 'this defiantly works for the challenge, really great angles and lines', '2009-06-15 21:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530312, 798917, 98339, '<td valign="top">quite a neat picture you have here..well done</td>', 'quite a neat picture you have here..well done', '2009-06-15 21:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530328, 799149, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is quite beautiful...the more I look at it the better I like it...</td>', 'this is quite beautiful...the more I look at it the better I like it...', '2009-06-15 21:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530330, 799305, 98339, '<td valign="top">what a really neat location...very well done</td>', 'what a really neat location...very well done', '2009-06-15 21:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530353, 799449, 76598, '<td valign="top">Does her back hurt?</td>', 'Does her back hurt?', '2009-06-15 21:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530379, 799263, 106233, '<td valign="top">Great composition! you just turned nothing into SOMETHING.</td>', 'Great composition! you just turned nothing into SOMETHING.', '2009-06-15 21:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530387, 799368, 106233, '<td valign="top">I would prefer a more deep DOF... but this is a nice shot!! Definetely a great composition!</td>', 'I would prefer a more deep DOF... but this is a nice shot!! Definetely a great composition!', '2009-06-15 21:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530391, 798167, 106233, '<td valign="top">I like it... but I think it is a little overexposed.</td>', 'I like it... but I think it is a little overexposed.', '2009-06-15 21:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530394, 799151, 106233, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle...</td>', 'Interesting angle...', '2009-06-15 21:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530396, 799287, 98339, '<td valign="top">Sorry but a bit to much blue for me...it distracts from the beauty of your shot</td>', 'Sorry but a bit to much blue for me...it distracts from the beauty of your shot', '2009-06-15 21:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530402, 799192, 98339, '<td valign="top">not sure if I will get this right or not....but your shot looks to have the saturation/hue taken way down...thus removing the color...in Duotone (and I am no expert by a long shot) I think you convert to B&amp;W then split your tones between 2 tones...thus duotone or split-tone...but they are somewhat equal in tone (I think)</td>', 'not sure if I will get this right or not....but your shot looks to have the saturation/hue taken way down...thus removing the color...in Duotone (and I am no expert by a long shot) I think you convert to B&W then split your tones between 2 tones...thus duotone or split-tone...but they are somewhat equal in tone (I think)', '2009-06-15 21:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
