(5530782, 799359, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, very nicely balanced composition.  I like that the background is not pure black - there''s a hint of the leaves behind, and I really like how the center is just becoming visible - you''ve caught that stage just before the bloom is completely open.  Focus is good, though the OOF foreward most leaf may put off some.  And I''d wager your score would be higher without the inner border - some people really don''t like borders, especially if there''s more to them than a simple black line, and in this shot, the blur is not entirely obvious unless you relaly look for it.  The tone is warm - reminiscent of low morning light.</td>', 'Lovely light, very nicely balanced composition.  I like that the background is not pure black - there''s a hint of the leaves behind, and I really like how the center is just becoming visible - you''ve caught that stage just before the bloom is completely open.  Focus is good, though the OOF foreward most leaf may put off some.  And I''d wager your score would be higher without the inner border - some people really don''t like borders, especially if there''s more to them than a simple black line, and in this shot, the blur is not entirely obvious unless you relaly look for it.  The tone is warm - reminiscent of low morning light.', '2009-06-16 01:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530783, 799156, 94239, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture, but I cant help thinking there is some thing missing here? Nicely edited, the effect adds to the cartoonish or 2 dimensional feel.</td>', 'Very interesting picture, but I cant help thinking there is some thing missing here? Nicely edited, the effect adds to the cartoonish or 2 dimensional feel.', '2009-06-16 01:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530784, 799455, 30982, '<td valign="top">The tilt of the hats - they''re both watching the same thing, but he with either binoculars or a camera (I first though binoculars, but then realized, duh - it could be a camera).  His body language says he finds it more interesting than she does; she''s with him because she''s always with him and wouldn''t have it any other way.  <br/> <br/>As for the toning, it has the warm yellow/gold of evening in summer.  There''s a section on the back of his shirt where it seems non-contiguous as far as the toning part - not sure why that is - and the tone doesn''t appear to continue into the sky.  These "technicals" may be unsettling to voters.  On my "sometimes too light" monitor, the back of her shirt is noisy.  Looks fine on my "sometimes too dark" monitor.</td>', 'The tilt of the hats - they''re both watching the same thing, but he with either binoculars or a camera (I first though binoculars, but then realized, duh - it could be a camera).  His body language says he finds it more interesting than she does; she''s with him because she''s always with him and wouldn''t have it any other way.   As for the toning, it has the warm yellow/gold of evening in summer.  There''s a section on the back of his shirt where it seems non-contiguous as far as the toning part - not sure why that is - and the tone doesn''t appear to continue into the sky.  These "technicals" may be unsettling to voters.  On my "sometimes too light" monitor, the back of her shirt is noisy.  Looks fine on my "sometimes too dark" monitor.', '2009-06-16 01:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530789, 798841, 94239, '<td valign="top">more like a yawn. but a good capture and nice contrast.</td>', 'more like a yawn. but a good capture and nice contrast.', '2009-06-16 01:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
