(5530960, 799211, 93756, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard (that''s a compliment). Gorgeous color and clarity.</td>', 'Looks like a postcard (that''s a compliment). Gorgeous color and clarity.', '2009-06-16 08:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530961, 799237, 93756, '<td valign="top">Thank you for being adventurous with color in this challenge! Nice to see pink!</td>', 'Thank you for being adventurous with color in this challenge! Nice to see pink!', '2009-06-16 08:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530962, 799156, 93756, '<td valign="top">Don''t get the title. Cool treatment making this look like an old postcard.</td>', 'Don''t get the title. Cool treatment making this look like an old postcard.', '2009-06-16 08:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530965, 798503, 93756, '<td valign="top">You''ve made it pretty - like the way the border picks up the color - but it is only a remote after all - hard to make it an interesting subject.</td>', 'You''ve made it pretty - like the way the border picks up the color - but it is only a remote after all - hard to make it an interesting subject.', '2009-06-16 08:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530966, 799287, 93756, '<td valign="top">Pretty but kind of a messy composition that could use a focal point. Like your choice of blue &amp; white.</td>', 'Pretty but kind of a messy composition that could use a focal point. Like your choice of blue & white.', '2009-06-16 08:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530970, 797905, 93756, '<td valign="top">Sky/flags are overexposed. Good choice of subject but color would have helped this. Even in duotone, you would have been better off choosing a brighter color.</td>', 'Sky/flags are overexposed. Good choice of subject but color would have helped this. Even in duotone, you would have been better off choosing a brighter color.', '2009-06-16 08:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530971, 799311, 93756, '<td valign="top">Just kind of boring. Your aren''t straight on at the door but not a enough of an angle to make it look intentional. You need more room at the bottom of the door so that it doesn''t look cut off.</td>', 'Just kind of boring. Your aren''t straight on at the door but not a enough of an angle to make it look intentional. You need more room at the bottom of the door so that it doesn''t look cut off.', '2009-06-16 08:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530972, 798400, 93756, '<td valign="top">The foliage in front is just boring. The windmill and sky are neat. Need more contrast in your dark/light colors to make the interesting elements stand out.</td>', 'The foliage in front is just boring. The windmill and sky are neat. Need more contrast in your dark/light colors to make the interesting elements stand out.', '2009-06-16 08:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530974, 799318, 93756, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the "color" - just looks muddy. But nice capture of the water - try it again in "Zen".</td>', 'Not crazy about the "color" - just looks muddy. But nice capture of the water - try it again in "Zen".', '2009-06-16 08:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530996, 798904, 101256, '<td valign="top">Adams was a photographer with an eye for the simple and while there are elements of that in this image, it is much to busy to truly evoke an impression of Adams or even an homage.  However, as a duo tone image, it works on several levels and technically, is a good demonstration of tone control even if it''s overly gray.</td>', 'Adams was a photographer with an eye for the simple and while there are elements of that in this image, it is much to busy to truly evoke an impression of Adams or even an homage.  However, as a duo tone image, it works on several levels and technically, is a good demonstration of tone control even if it''s overly gray.', '2009-06-16 09:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5530997, 799199, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s the effort that should be applauded rather than the technique or artistic impression.  This is a great effort showing a good eye for a detail that most would have overlooked or even ignored. While not a perfect duo-tone image, or even one that could be called "duo-tone", it''s the eye and capture that is important here, not the technical or artistic scoring.</td>', 'Sometimes it''s the effort that should be applauded rather than the technique or artistic impression.  This is a great effort showing a good eye for a detail that most would have overlooked or even ignored. While not a perfect duo-tone image, or even one that could be called "duo-tone", it''s the eye and capture that is important here, not the technical or artistic scoring.', '2009-06-16 09:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531013, 799118, 57447, '<td valign="top">Good use of duotone on the dragonfly.</td>', 'Good use of duotone on the dragonfly.', '2009-06-16 09:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531087, 798986, 107190, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2009-06-16 10:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531176, 799369, 24454, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this in person.  It looks so striking in this photo.  That is a mote around it, right?  The blue-gray tones are a perfect fit for this.</td>', 'I would love to see this in person.  It looks so striking in this photo.  That is a mote around it, right?  The blue-gray tones are a perfect fit for this.', '2009-06-16 12:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531178, 798952, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!  I have been voting and have realized how many photos just are not enhanced by a duotone conversion at all.  Not so with this one.  The contrasts of darks and lights are beautiful, and the ambiance of the photo is <i>made</i> by the duotone conversion.  Even with the pout, that is one stunningly beautiful little girl!</td>', 'This is wonderful!  I have been voting and have realized how many photos just are not enhanced by a duotone conversion at all.  Not so with this one.  The contrasts of darks and lights are beautiful, and the ambiance of the photo is made by the duotone conversion.  Even with the pout, that is one stunningly beautiful little girl!', '2009-06-16 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531250, 799297, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww, since it looks like he''s popping out of my computer screen, it makes me just wanna start giving him kisses on that cute little nose  :)</td>', 'Awwww, since it looks like he''s popping out of my computer screen, it makes me just wanna start giving him kisses on that cute little nose  :)', '2009-06-16 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531255, 799225, 41357, '<td valign="top">this one is cool (maybe a bit to much blur filter) -8</td>', 'this one is cool (maybe a bit to much blur filter) -8', '2009-06-16 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531260, 799276, 41357, '<td valign="top">the best shot so far -10</td>', 'the best shot so far -10', '2009-06-16 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531261, 799360, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the architecture, but I suspect this is not coming across as a true duotone - more like a color shot with just red, white and black.  Most true duotones (at least the way I understand them, have the "hue" throughout.  For instance if this was a red toned image, there wouldn''t be any whites.  Does that make sense?</td>', 'I like the light and the architecture, but I suspect this is not coming across as a true duotone - more like a color shot with just red, white and black.  Most true duotones (at least the way I understand them, have the "hue" throughout.  For instance if this was a red toned image, there wouldn''t be any whites.  Does that make sense?', '2009-06-16 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531264, 799360, 41357, '<td valign="top">very strong -9</td>', 'very strong -9', '2009-06-16 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531265, 798763, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one of those rare shots for me where I almost think it would work better in color.  Yeah, I know, bite my tongue!  But you''ve got all those displays and billboards in color vying for attention (which of course will make it entirely too busy, but in my opinion that''s the point of it all) but in B&amp;W (or in this case a duotone) it becomes a bit more of a mishmash than a happy medley.  As for the duotone bit, you can use the CS4 options - I like some of ''em - or you can use a color balance adjustment layer and play with the sliders to find a combo you like.</td>', 'This is one of those rare shots for me where I almost think it would work better in color.  Yeah, I know, bite my tongue!  But you''ve got all those displays and billboards in color vying for attention (which of course will make it entirely too busy, but in my opinion that''s the point of it all) but in B&W (or in this case a duotone) it becomes a bit more of a mishmash than a happy medley.  As for the duotone bit, you can use the CS4 options - I like some of ''em - or you can use a color balance adjustment layer and play with the sliders to find a combo you like.', '2009-06-16 14:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531275, 799079, 41357, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2009-06-16 14:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531281, 799078, 41357, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to start thinking what is in this picture<br/>(the doctor says I have a vivid imagination and I still didn''t take my pills)</td>', 'I don''t want to start thinking what is in this picture(the doctor says I have a vivid imagination and I still didn''t take my pills)', '2009-06-16 14:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
