(5531947, 799277, 106233, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the fact that all the lines on the picture (the wings of the sugar cup, the spoon and the milk) are paralels, but not the line of the (mouth of the milk cup) is a little disturbing to me. Also, i cant avoid to look at the line on the table on the right bottom (the junction of the wood). I think it would be better if you avoided it.<br/>PS.: Sorry for my english... today im lazy to research the words i dont know...</td>', 'I like the idea, but the fact that all the lines on the picture (the wings of the sugar cup, the spoon and the milk) are paralels, but not the line of the (mouth of the milk cup) is a little disturbing to me. Also, i cant avoid to look at the line on the table on the right bottom (the junction of the wood). I think it would be better if you avoided it.PS.: Sorry for my english... today im lazy to research the words i dont know...', '2009-06-16 22:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531951, 797932, 98647, '<td valign="top">It feels unbalanced to me. I would have cropped off the left 1/3 and worked with the right side. Unfortunately, the wire is there and that''s a distraction.</td>', 'It feels unbalanced to me. I would have cropped off the left 1/3 and worked with the right side. Unfortunately, the wire is there and that''s a distraction.', '2009-06-16 22:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
