(5533250, 799356, 34192, '<td valign="top">I usually hate images of other peoples art work.  But here, the artwork is just a shadow for the light to bounce off of.  Rather than being static, as images of statues usually are, this one is full of life and movement. Very well done. For me, the composition is not very strong but you really did a great job with the tonal range.</td>', 'I usually hate images of other peoples art work.  But here, the artwork is just a shadow for the light to bounce off of.  Rather than being static, as images of statues usually are, this one is full of life and movement. Very well done. For me, the composition is not very strong but you really did a great job with the tonal range.', '2009-06-17 13:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533262, 798917, 92294, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if you cut off about 2/3 of the water, and showed more sky. It only takes a little water to show what that''s all about, but there''s stuff going on in the sky that we can''t see that may be more interesting. That would also keep the horizon from being almost smack dab in the middle, too.</td>', 'I would like this better if you cut off about 2/3 of the water, and showed more sky. It only takes a little water to show what that''s all about, but there''s stuff going on in the sky that we can''t see that may be more interesting. That would also keep the horizon from being almost smack dab in the middle, too.', '2009-06-17 13:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533268, 799309, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is stunningly fine. I''m only 10% through voting right now but this is by far the best I''ve seen yet. Well done.</td>', 'This is stunningly fine. I''m only 10% through voting right now but this is by far the best I''ve seen yet. Well done.', '2009-06-17 13:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
