(5533278, 799425, 34192, '<td valign="top">Its funny, the first thing that popped into my head was religion based, christian in particular.  She''s standing on the ''cross'' somewhat embracing it with joy by the way she''s holding her hands... at any rate, I think the composition works well and the toning is well done.  Good luck in the challenge...</td>', 'Its funny, the first thing that popped into my head was religion based, christian in particular.  She''s standing on the ''cross'' somewhat embracing it with joy by the way she''s holding her hands... at any rate, I think the composition works well and the toning is well done.  Good luck in the challenge...', '2009-06-17 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533280, 799173, 34192, '<td valign="top">The colors make this image work for me.  Your lighting is wonderful, the composition strong, darks and lights well played, but I love the almost jarring magenta tones that really make one stop and contemplate.  Great choice of an unusual color for duotone.</td>', 'The colors make this image work for me.  Your lighting is wonderful, the composition strong, darks and lights well played, but I love the almost jarring magenta tones that really make one stop and contemplate.  Great choice of an unusual color for duotone.', '2009-06-17 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533281, 799273, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It is and it isn''t. It has a sense of history hidden in the wavering feel - like I''m looking across time.  well conceived.  composition a little odd - the monument is almost overwhelming the figure who is getting ready to be attacked by an alien from the future...Its all unsettling, but if he''s lucky, he will make it through the portal in time...tones excellent.  thanks for letting me look!</td>', 'I like this.  It is and it isn''t. It has a sense of history hidden in the wavering feel - like I''m looking across time.  well conceived.  composition a little odd - the monument is almost overwhelming the figure who is getting ready to be attacked by an alien from the future...Its all unsettling, but if he''s lucky, he will make it through the portal in time...tones excellent.  thanks for letting me look!', '2009-06-17 13:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
