(5534099, 799333, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is quite interesting...when I was in Mississippi this past month I got to see one of these tractors in action they are quite amazing to watch...really like your balance of tone(s)</td>', 'this is quite interesting...when I was in Mississippi this past month I got to see one of these tractors in action they are quite amazing to watch...really like your balance of tone(s)', '2009-06-17 22:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
