(5534105, 798008, 51747, '<td valign="top">This might not do well because it isn''t readily recognizable or particularly interesting. It does meet the challenge.</td>', 'This might not do well because it isn''t readily recognizable or particularly interesting. It does meet the challenge.', '2009-06-17 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
