(5534126, 799242, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty idea but not crazy about the artifacts around the roses - probably created in a glow filter or in editing.</td>', 'Pretty idea but not crazy about the artifacts around the roses - probably created in a glow filter or in editing.', '2009-06-17 22:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534128, 799338, 98339, '<td valign="top">just realized those are little spoons on the sides...personally IMO I think I would have turned them just a tad more, or stepped them (2nd pushed back, 3rd farther, 4th farther yet)</td>', 'just realized those are little spoons on the sides...personally IMO I think I would have turned them just a tad more, or stepped them (2nd pushed back, 3rd farther, 4th farther yet)', '2009-06-17 22:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
