(5534132, 798994, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like the image overall. I wish the point of focus was somewhere else. Not sure where, but just not the lower right.</td>', 'I like the image overall. I wish the point of focus was somewhere else. Not sure where, but just not the lower right.', '2009-06-17 22:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
