(5534174, 799393, 51747, '<td valign="top">You have chosen an interesting subject. The processing is a bit strong for my taste in this image. I think it takes away from the main subject by having so many highlighted areas.</td>', 'You have chosen an interesting subject. The processing is a bit strong for my taste in this image. I think it takes away from the main subject by having so many highlighted areas.', '2009-06-17 22:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
