(5534188, 798268, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very nice in purple</td>', 'Very nice in purple', '2009-06-17 22:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534199, 799146, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like this choice of color/tone. I give you credit for looking outside the box.</td>', 'I like this choice of color/tone. I give you credit for looking outside the box.', '2009-06-17 23:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534201, 799218, 83313, '<td valign="top">There may be some extra JPEG compression taking away some detail. I noticed some compression artifacts on the handle and the bucket. Your file size is only 36k and you could have used up to 150k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.</td>', 'There may be some extra JPEG compression taking away some detail. I noticed some compression artifacts on the handle and the bucket. Your file size is only 36k and you could have used up to 150k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.', '2009-06-17 23:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534203, 798530, 51747, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2009-06-17 23:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534204, 799074, 51747, '<td valign="top">The light is just right.</td>', 'The light is just right.', '2009-06-17 23:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534207, 799078, 51747, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s on the wall. ;)</td>', 'Looks like it''s on the wall. ;)', '2009-06-17 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534209, 799354, 83313, '<td valign="top">The classic pinup girl, often copied. Somehow I don''t think these are really her legs, considering she passed away recently. Very nice pinup pic nonetheless. Whose legs ARE they? I suppose I will know in a few days.</td>', 'The classic pinup girl, often copied. Somehow I don''t think these are really her legs, considering she passed away recently. Very nice pinup pic nonetheless. Whose legs ARE they? I suppose I will know in a few days.', '2009-06-17 23:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
