(5534212, 799133, 83313, '<td valign="top">I hope to be able to do people shots like this someday. A 10 and a fave.</td>', 'I hope to be able to do people shots like this someday. A 10 and a fave.', '2009-06-17 23:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
