(5534789, 799319, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting luminosity to this.</td>', 'Interesting luminosity to this.', '2009-06-18 10:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534803, 798511, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you were trying to show me.  The background is in better focus than the dog (who needs a nail clip) and is quite cluttered.  The dog is tied out, not running free, and what I presume is his water bowl is overturned and he''s panting, which makes me want to get the poor thing some water on such a sunny day.  I feel sorry for him.  The fact that he''s not in focus just adds to my feeling that he isn''t a priority for anyone.  And since this has made me so thoughtful, I can''t just dismiss it as an OOF pet portrait.  It disturbs me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you were trying to show me.  The background is in better focus than the dog (who needs a nail clip) and is quite cluttered.  The dog is tied out, not running free, and what I presume is his water bowl is overturned and he''s panting, which makes me want to get the poor thing some water on such a sunny day.  I feel sorry for him.  The fact that he''s not in focus just adds to my feeling that he isn''t a priority for anyone.  And since this has made me so thoughtful, I can''t just dismiss it as an OOF pet portrait.  It disturbs me.', '2009-06-18 11:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5534873, 799295, 98339, '<td valign="top">your focus seems to be a little soft to me</td>', 'your focus seems to be a little soft to me', '2009-06-18 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
