(5535254, 798780, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hi Katherine. You should really hide the dupes of your challenge entries that are in your portfolio. I remembered seeing this one within the last several days.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=798474" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/88136/120/798474.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/88136/120/798474.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/88136/120/798474.jpg"/></a> <br/>I like the close cropped mono better. The purple sweater in the other one is just too strong relative to the rest of the scene, and it grabs my eye instead of the subject. This version goes close in and focuses on her eyes. It''s got a very different feel.</td>', 'Hi Katherine. You should really hide the dupes of your challenge entries that are in your portfolio. I remembered seeing this one within the last several days. I like the close cropped mono better. The purple sweater in the other one is just too strong relative to the rest of the scene, and it grabs my eye instead of the subject. This version goes close in and focuses on her eyes. It''s got a very different feel.', '2009-06-18 15:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
