(5535634, 798880, 55956, '<td valign="top">mmm probably a crop on the left side was a better choice. the photograph is composed from right to left perhaps this is a bit unusual(but not an error!) as my personal opinion reflect the  image around the vertical could be a good idea for a better result</td>', 'mmm probably a crop on the left side was a better choice. the photograph is composed from right to left perhaps this is a bit unusual(but not an error!) as my personal opinion reflect the  image around the vertical could be a good idea for a better result', '2009-06-18 20:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
