(5535700, 799141, 98339, '<td valign="top">from the dark side.....hmmm Excellent focus great tone</td>', 'from the dark side.....hmmm Excellent focus great tone', '2009-06-18 21:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535701, 799074, 98339, '<td valign="top">well she looks comfy...well done</td>', 'well she looks comfy...well done', '2009-06-18 21:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535704, 798261, 98339, '<td valign="top">you missed his ear...personally I would have liked to see more of the horses head rather than his rear</td>', 'you missed his ear...personally I would have liked to see more of the horses head rather than his rear', '2009-06-18 21:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535706, 798869, 98339, '<td valign="top">aren''t they amazing...such interesting creations aren''t they...well done</td>', 'aren''t they amazing...such interesting creations aren''t they...well done', '2009-06-18 21:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535707, 799391, 98339, '<td valign="top">you have a very good silhouette of the ship here...nice capture</td>', 'you have a very good silhouette of the ship here...nice capture', '2009-06-18 21:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535708, 799357, 98339, '<td valign="top">wow...that is red!!  kind of makes a cool picture</td>', 'wow...that is red!!  kind of makes a cool picture', '2009-06-18 21:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535711, 799189, 98339, '<td valign="top">it seems to me that you shot is overexposed...the location is wonderful but so very bright</td>', 'it seems to me that you shot is overexposed...the location is wonderful but so very bright', '2009-06-18 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535714, 799450, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is a really cool location...where ever is it?  Looks maybe like Colorado?  overall the picture is just a touch to dark/underexposed...</td>', 'this is a really cool location...where ever is it?  Looks maybe like Colorado?  overall the picture is just a touch to dark/underexposed...', '2009-06-18 21:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535715, 799107, 98339, '<td valign="top">that''s a loooonnnngggg ways down!!! cool angles and curves.</td>', 'that''s a loooonnnngggg ways down!!! cool angles and curves.', '2009-06-18 21:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535717, 799375, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is very well done...I am bumping up your score...excellent processing</td>', 'this is very well done...I am bumping up your score...excellent processing', '2009-06-18 21:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5535726, 799043, 98339, '<td valign="top">your focus is to soft for me...</td>', 'your focus is to soft for me...', '2009-06-18 22:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536005, 798806, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me a little of Superman''s fortress of solitude from the movies.</td>', 'Reminds me a little of Superman''s fortress of solitude from the movies.', '2009-06-19 02:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536006, 799078, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of this. Vaguely looks like a human form drawn. Well, anything that makes me stop to think and examine it closer deserves some pointage for that.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of this. Vaguely looks like a human form drawn. Well, anything that makes me stop to think and examine it closer deserves some pointage for that.', '2009-06-19 02:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536007, 799226, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has the look of something pulled from an old newspaper. I am assuming that is the look you were going for, so well done.</td>', 'Has the look of something pulled from an old newspaper. I am assuming that is the look you were going for, so well done.', '2009-06-19 02:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536008, 799381, 83313, '<td valign="top">Your treatment makes it a purple heron. (Well purple-ish...)You''ve invented a new breed!</td>', 'Your treatment makes it a purple heron. (Well purple-ish...)You''ve invented a new breed!', '2009-06-19 02:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536010, 797836, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch the JPEG compression. I see some artifacts around the tip of the land and a 47k file size says you could have easily avoided it with less compression.</td>', 'Watch the JPEG compression. I see some artifacts around the tip of the land and a 47k file size says you could have easily avoided it with less compression.', '2009-06-19 02:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536011, 799276, 83313, '<td valign="top">A fun and unique view of the eye. Extra pointage for originality. Seeing how close you were, I''m curious if you had any trouble with the police trying to chase you and your camera away. I recall a huge stink about that with a couple of DPC''ers several years ago.</td>', 'A fun and unique view of the eye. Extra pointage for originality. Seeing how close you were, I''m curious if you had any trouble with the police trying to chase you and your camera away. I recall a huge stink about that with a couple of DPC''ers several years ago.', '2009-06-19 02:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536012, 799255, 83313, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the story is?</td>', 'I wonder what the story is?', '2009-06-19 02:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536043, 798738, 88247, '<td valign="top">A stunning Rose,beautiful and perfect:-)<br/>Has left me wondering what colour it is?</td>', 'A stunning Rose,beautiful and perfect:-)Has left me wondering what colour it is?', '2009-06-19 03:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536044, 797905, 88247, '<td valign="top">"Childhood memories"<br/>This shot has so taken me back in time:-) <br/>Btw,love the title!!!;-)</td>', '"Childhood memories"This shot has so taken me back in time:-) Btw,love the title!!!;-)', '2009-06-19 03:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536045, 799146, 88247, '<td valign="top">It certainly does!!<br/>I love the way you have done this shot:-)</td>', 'It certainly does!!I love the way you have done this shot:-)', '2009-06-19 03:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536051, 799267, 107883, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2009-06-19 03:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536297, 799432, 61396, '<td valign="top">And a nice effect it is! (not voting)</td>', 'And a nice effect it is! (not voting)', '2009-06-19 10:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536300, 798958, 61396, '<td valign="top">Nice quote (not voting)</td>', 'Nice quote (not voting)', '2009-06-19 10:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536443, 798867, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the way the light is hitting this. There is, of course, a lot of sepia being seen in this challenge, but when working on my own entry, I realized this is because brownish tones enhance many images quite well. It is just what works.  The distinctive appearance of the caps of the ''shrooms suggests to me that you may have used a Topaz product on this. About my only real nitpick is that I find it cropped a little too tight for my own preferences. I gave this one a fairly high vote.</td>', 'I like the tones and the way the light is hitting this. There is, of course, a lot of sepia being seen in this challenge, but when working on my own entry, I realized this is because brownish tones enhance many images quite well. It is just what works.  The distinctive appearance of the caps of the ''shrooms suggests to me that you may have used a Topaz product on this. About my only real nitpick is that I find it cropped a little too tight for my own preferences. I gave this one a fairly high vote.', '2009-06-19 12:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536451, 799359, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of floral shots, mostly because I find it is just too easy to get an attractive photo of a pretty flower, so when I vote on one, there has to be something well done to make it stand out to  me. The composition is spot-on rule of thirds and leads my eye nicely through the frame. The treatment and light is nice, being just soft enough to be pleasing, but still has lots of details showing. (I love to see lots of fine detail). The border didn''t have much effect on me one way or another, but it probably does add a nice touch. I think the objection to it may be that it overlays with the actual subject matter. I really can''t find anything to nitpick about here, and I gave this a very high vote.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of floral shots, mostly because I find it is just too easy to get an attractive photo of a pretty flower, so when I vote on one, there has to be something well done to make it stand out to  me. The composition is spot-on rule of thirds and leads my eye nicely through the frame. The treatment and light is nice, being just soft enough to be pleasing, but still has lots of details showing. (I love to see lots of fine detail). The border didn''t have much effect on me one way or another, but it probably does add a nice touch. I think the objection to it may be that it overlays with the actual subject matter. I really can''t find anything to nitpick about here, and I gave this a very high vote.', '2009-06-19 12:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536456, 799239, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this because of the wonderful fog and the dimension it gives to this landscape. Composition-wise, I felt my eye being drawn both to the mountains and to the line of fog shrouded trees in the foreground. Neither stood out as the main subject over the other. I''m not a big fan of square crops and I will only use one myself when nothing else seems right for it. Not sure if it was the best here or not. I''d have to see the uncropped image. The overall appearance struck me as similar to a shot I posted in a side challenge recently.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=793408" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/793408.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/793408.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/793408.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>The gold tone might be a little strong for some viewers, but my own entry is a rip-your-eyes-out-of-the-sockets color, so who am I to nitpick that aspect?<br/> <br/>In spite of some aspects that did not work for me, this got a reasonably high vote from me because the aspects that I did like worked very well for me.</td>', 'I like this because of the wonderful fog and the dimension it gives to this landscape. Composition-wise, I felt my eye being drawn both to the mountains and to the line of fog shrouded trees in the foreground. Neither stood out as the main subject over the other. I''m not a big fan of square crops and I will only use one myself when nothing else seems right for it. Not sure if it was the best here or not. I''d have to see the uncropped image. The overall appearance struck me as similar to a shot I posted in a side challenge recently.  The gold tone might be a little strong for some viewers, but my own entry is a rip-your-eyes-out-of-the-sockets color, so who am I to nitpick that aspect? In spite of some aspects that did not work for me, this got a reasonably high vote from me because the aspects that I did like worked very well for me.', '2009-06-19 12:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536480, 799135, 67579, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! very well done! I have a feeling I recognize this work but will hold my tongue just in case lol.</td>', 'Beautiful! very well done! I have a feeling I recognize this work but will hold my tongue just in case lol.', '2009-06-19 13:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536482, 798434, 67579, '<td valign="top">Im sure some will slam you for the tilted perspective but I quite like it :)</td>', 'Im sure some will slam you for the tilted perspective but I quite like it :)', '2009-06-19 13:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536492, 798400, 67579, '<td valign="top">Um what exactly is a "Stom"? Dont worry, I rate the photos not the spelling ;)</td>', 'Um what exactly is a "Stom"? Dont worry, I rate the photos not the spelling ;)', '2009-06-19 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536503, 799199, 67579, '<td valign="top">great find :)</td>', 'great find :)', '2009-06-19 13:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536520, 799309, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is incredibly creative, very moving and unworldly...9</td>', 'this is incredibly creative, very moving and unworldly...9', '2009-06-19 13:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536596, 799360, 68956, '<td valign="top">I love the different take on a dutone - I presume a ready made one, or maybe you added the red/orange? The composition is nicely unbalanced rather than giving in to all that symmetry and order in the building. A good graphic image and a topical title :)</td>', 'I love the different take on a dutone - I presume a ready made one, or maybe you added the red/orange? The composition is nicely unbalanced rather than giving in to all that symmetry and order in the building. A good graphic image and a topical title :)', '2009-06-19 14:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536731, 799328, 103309, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! 10. My fav so far : )</td>', 'Fantastic! 10. My fav so far : )', '2009-06-19 16:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536733, 798540, 103309, '<td valign="top">extremely well done...9</td>', 'extremely well done...9', '2009-06-19 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536734, 799449, 103309, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot  (7) ummm...red? Say''s you!</td>', 'Very nice shot  (7) ummm...red? Say''s you!', '2009-06-19 16:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536864, 798408, 47470, '<td valign="top">Was there any way you could have taken this from a little lower?  The cliff looks so cool, but it would stand out more if the top of it fell into the sky instead of against the similarly toned hills in the background.</td>', 'Was there any way you could have taken this from a little lower?  The cliff looks so cool, but it would stand out more if the top of it fell into the sky instead of against the similarly toned hills in the background.', '2009-06-19 19:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536866, 798268, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  I think the purple hue is a little strong for my taste though.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  I think the purple hue is a little strong for my taste though.', '2009-06-19 19:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536868, 798986, 47470, '<td valign="top">Love it!  I can feel the coolness and dampness!</td>', 'Love it!  I can feel the coolness and dampness!', '2009-06-19 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536870, 799422, 47470, '<td valign="top">The outside of the near eye definitely looks in focus, but it seems strange that the pupil doesn''t.  It makes him look sleepy.  I might have burned it to make it looks a bit sharper.</td>', 'The outside of the near eye definitely looks in focus, but it seems strange that the pupil doesn''t.  It makes him look sleepy.  I might have burned it to make it looks a bit sharper.', '2009-06-19 19:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536873, 799118, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the wings!  I think I might have cropped a bit from the bottom and the left to set him off-center.</td>', 'Great detail on the wings!  I think I might have cropped a bit from the bottom and the left to set him off-center.', '2009-06-19 19:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536875, 798503, 47470, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really pretty and soft, but I don''t really like how the crop cuts off parts of the phone while leaving unnecessary background.</td>', 'The lighting is really pretty and soft, but I don''t really like how the crop cuts off parts of the phone while leaving unnecessary background.', '2009-06-19 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536877, 799453, 47470, '<td valign="top">He''s got some great eyes!  But looking at them so long made me realize that the right pupil is darker than the left and that feels weird to me.  I might have evened that out a bit.  Very nice portrait.</td>', 'He''s got some great eyes!  But looking at them so long made me realize that the right pupil is darker than the left and that feels weird to me.  I might have evened that out a bit.  Very nice portrait.', '2009-06-19 19:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536882, 798172, 47470, '<td valign="top">The distortion and the color work great with this shot.  The only nit-picky thing I saw was that the two central telescopes blend into the black circle on the ceiling.  Was there any way you could have moved to separate them?</td>', 'The distortion and the color work great with this shot.  The only nit-picky thing I saw was that the two central telescopes blend into the black circle on the ceiling.  Was there any way you could have moved to separate them?', '2009-06-19 19:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536884, 799361, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of the settings so I could see what he''s so angry at!</td>', 'I wish I could see more of the settings so I could see what he''s so angry at!', '2009-06-19 19:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536886, 798948, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great tones!  Did you crop any off the sides?  I might have left a little more room on the left and/or top so they wouldn''t look trapped and peaceful at the same time : )</td>', 'Great tones!  Did you crop any off the sides?  I might have left a little more room on the left and/or top so they wouldn''t look trapped and peaceful at the same time : )', '2009-06-19 20:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536887, 798658, 47470, '<td valign="top">The heaviness of the pear seems to contradict the soft, calm feeling I get from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'The heaviness of the pear seems to contradict the soft, calm feeling I get from the rest of the photo.', '2009-06-19 20:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
