(5538713, 799430, 66515, '<td valign="top">the central object (the tree) is really underexposed and with it being smack dab in the middle it really prevents the viewer from enjoying the rest of the scene</td>', 'the central object (the tree) is really underexposed and with it being smack dab in the middle it really prevents the viewer from enjoying the rest of the scene', '2009-06-21 23:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538714, 799311, 66515, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would really make this pop. Great subject for the challenge.</td>', 'A bit more contrast would really make this pop. Great subject for the challenge.', '2009-06-21 23:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538715, 799302, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great image but I''m not sure if monochrome (or duotone for that matter) is the best way to present it. I really want to see the colors in this image. Then again, you''ve captured the textures really well which does make it a good candidate for monochrome. Tough call.</td>', 'Great image but I''m not sure if monochrome (or duotone for that matter) is the best way to present it. I really want to see the colors in this image. Then again, you''ve captured the textures really well which does make it a good candidate for monochrome. Tough call.', '2009-06-21 23:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538716, 799345, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really great subject for the challenge and presented well. Terrific focus on the eye and good detail captured where its needed. The soft focus on the outside of the image as well as the vignette may have been added in post but its done well without being too heavy handed.</td>', 'Really great subject for the challenge and presented well. Terrific focus on the eye and good detail captured where its needed. The soft focus on the outside of the image as well as the vignette may have been added in post but its done well without being too heavy handed.', '2009-06-21 23:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538718, 797888, 66515, '<td valign="top">I think the needs to be shown in color. The mass of flowers in the foreground look too uniform in monochrome to be interesting.</td>', 'I think the needs to be shown in color. The mass of flowers in the foreground look too uniform in monochrome to be interesting.', '2009-06-21 23:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538730, 798355, 15711, '<td valign="top">Woah.  Helluva night shot.  Loving the star flare.  Great perspective, lines and tones.  Good luck. Just thought I''d tell you this is one of two 10''s I gave in the challenge.</td>', 'Woah.  Helluva night shot.  Loving the star flare.  Great perspective, lines and tones.  Good luck. Just thought I''d tell you this is one of two 10''s I gave in the challenge.', '2009-06-21 23:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
