(5538854, 797821, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but either it''s a very tight crop of a much larger photograph, or the focus just wasn''t there to begin with.  As RKT notes, it *looks* like it''s been plasticized - a common result of too much noise-reduction software.  There is no detail in the feathers, and while "soft" most definitely CAN work, here it doesn''t do it for me because of the plastic-like oversmoothed appearance.  Hopefully this helps explain your score a bit.  (I was one of your 5s.)</td>', 'Good composition, but either it''s a very tight crop of a much larger photograph, or the focus just wasn''t there to begin with.  As RKT notes, it *looks* like it''s been plasticized - a common result of too much noise-reduction software.  There is no detail in the feathers, and while "soft" most definitely CAN work, here it doesn''t do it for me because of the plastic-like oversmoothed appearance.  Hopefully this helps explain your score a bit.  (I was one of your 5s.)', '2009-06-22 01:12:32.000000', NULL, 0),
