(5539023, 799309, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice showing.  Looks like you got a bunch of 5''s.  It was definitely better than that.  Your tones and capture of the shadows and highlights is stunning and haunting.</td>', 'Nice showing.  Looks like you got a bunch of 5''s.  It was definitely better than that.  Your tones and capture of the shadows and highlights is stunning and haunting.', '2009-06-22 01:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539024, 799195, 70484, '<td valign="top">I sure would like to know why people voted this lower. I thought it was a great display of the dry season. I really liked the composition and coloring. I guess I don''t understand DPC voters.</td>', 'I sure would like to know why people voted this lower. I thought it was a great display of the dry season. I really liked the composition and coloring. I guess I don''t understand DPC voters.', '2009-06-22 01:50:16.000000', NULL, 0),
