(5539042, 798986, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW MICHELLE .. !!!<br/>the thumb doesnt do this one justice at all .. on opening it was such a kapow .. !!<br/>love the excellent details, the brilliant droplets and killer tones .. congrats on a great place in the challenge and leaves made STUNNING .. !!!</td>', 'WOW MICHELLE .. !!!the thumb doesnt do this one justice at all .. on opening it was such a kapow .. !!love the excellent details, the brilliant droplets and killer tones .. congrats on a great place in the challenge and leaves made STUNNING .. !!!', '2009-06-22 01:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
