(5539055, 799406, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, Brian, I LOVE this image. The colors are gorgeous, and so very different than the traditional duotone combinations. The composition is lovely too. Excellent!</td>', 'Wow, Brian, I LOVE this image. The colors are gorgeous, and so very different than the traditional duotone combinations. The composition is lovely too. Excellent!', '2009-06-22 02:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
