(5539062, 799452, 60173, '<td valign="top">I submitted a shot very similar to this in the Best of 2008 challenge, and it just as miserable, heh. We''re so misunderstood.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=755813" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/980/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_755813.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/980/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_755813.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/980/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_755813.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I submitted a shot very similar to this in the Best of 2008 challenge, and it just as miserable, heh. We''re so misunderstood. ', '2009-06-22 02:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539065, 799197, 66384, '<td valign="top">Delightful. The couple and the architecture complement each other perfectly. I like the way the people are a bit in the shadow and the mall is bright. This is really an outstanding capture of a marvelous moment.</td>', 'Delightful. The couple and the architecture complement each other perfectly. I like the way the people are a bit in the shadow and the mall is bright. This is really an outstanding capture of a marvelous moment.', '2009-06-22 02:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
