(5539095, 798806, 72134, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments. I jumped out of the bus and had only 10 minutes to take a few shots ther by the lagoon, the waether was terrible dark and rainy. When I came home I took all colors out except the cyan/blue. It is the real color of  some big iceblocks coming from a glacier, this color is unbeilvable and you also can see it on iceblocks that sometimes are drifting over here from Greenland. But still I dont''t understand how some people can vote 1-3 for photos fhat are technically fine, though they don''t like submission.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments. I jumped out of the bus and had only 10 minutes to take a few shots ther by the lagoon, the waether was terrible dark and rainy. When I came home I took all colors out except the cyan/blue. It is the real color of  some big iceblocks coming from a glacier, this color is unbeilvable and you also can see it on iceblocks that sometimes are drifting over here from Greenland. But still I dont''t understand how some people can vote 1-3 for photos fhat are technically fine, though they don''t like submission.', '2009-06-22 03:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
