(5539180, 799439, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet; nice quiet moment captured.  And congrats to Laurie!  She had a fine photog capturing the memories for her, too.</td>', 'Very sweet; nice quiet moment captured.  And congrats to Laurie!  She had a fine photog capturing the memories for her, too.', '2009-06-22 05:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
