(5539184, 799314, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, Tim. Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, Tim. Congrats on your ribbon.', '2009-06-22 05:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539186, 798880, 52549, '<td valign="top">Perfection! Congrats on 5th place, Sandy. Fabulous work.</td>', 'Perfection! Congrats on 5th place, Sandy. Fabulous work.', '2009-06-22 05:52:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539191, 799309, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent, Judy!  Pleased to see this scored well - and should have been higher in the standings, in my opinion.  Lovely, emotive shot and exquisitely processed.</td>', 'Excellent, Judy!  Pleased to see this scored well - and should have been higher in the standings, in my opinion.  Lovely, emotive shot and exquisitely processed.', '2009-06-22 06:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539194, 799079, 60173, '<td valign="top">So subtly gorgeous. I can''t look at it and not see the trees gracefully swaying their branches and dancing. I don''t remember seeing this when I was looking through the challenge earlier this week, not that I was voting anyway. I''m sure glad others took notice and put you in the top 10.<br/> <br/>You made a great choice leaving they misty greyness rather than pushing up the contrast and making the trees darker, which is probably what I would have tried to begin with. That would have easily made this too cluttered.</td>', 'So subtly gorgeous. I can''t look at it and not see the trees gracefully swaying their branches and dancing. I don''t remember seeing this when I was looking through the challenge earlier this week, not that I was voting anyway. I''m sure glad others took notice and put you in the top 10. You made a great choice leaving they misty greyness rather than pushing up the contrast and making the trees darker, which is probably what I would have tried to begin with. That would have easily made this too cluttered.', '2009-06-22 06:22:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539195, 799406, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very bold duotone!  Beyond what most probably see as a "duotone" but completely within the guidelines in my book.  I quite love how the texture in the water is echoed in the sky, only in a different color.  Very impressive shot and processing.</td>', 'Very bold duotone!  Beyond what most probably see as a "duotone" but completely within the guidelines in my book.  I quite love how the texture in the water is echoed in the sky, only in a different color.  Very impressive shot and processing.', '2009-06-22 06:26:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539196, 799118, 30982, '<td valign="top">Exactly, about the dragonfly.  That single blade is what grabs me, draws me in, holds me; the bokeh is to die for and really forms a lovely stage for the blade.  Is this a new lens or just one I haven''t paid attention to in your arsenal?  (I''d never be able to handhold that sucker and I''m too lazy to carry a tripod, but it does have remarkable bokeh!)  The dragonfly is a spectacular addition to all of the above.  This would have been an excellent entry for Zen as well - very peaceful and restful.</td>', 'Exactly, about the dragonfly.  That single blade is what grabs me, draws me in, holds me; the bokeh is to die for and really forms a lovely stage for the blade.  Is this a new lens or just one I haven''t paid attention to in your arsenal?  (I''d never be able to handhold that sucker and I''m too lazy to carry a tripod, but it does have remarkable bokeh!)  The dragonfly is a spectacular addition to all of the above.  This would have been an excellent entry for Zen as well - very peaceful and restful.', '2009-06-22 06:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539198, 797932, 30982, '<td valign="top">Leaves me wanting to know what was bricked out in the middle.  Something has been subdued, erased.</td>', 'Leaves me wanting to know what was bricked out in the middle.  Something has been subdued, erased.', '2009-06-22 06:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5539199, 798986, 79955, '<td valign="top">WOW !!!!! congrats on a Top 10.  You definitely have the vision &amp; the skill to get the result. Wonderful.</td>', 'WOW !!!!! congrats on a Top 10.  You definitely have the vision & the skill to get the result. Wonderful.', '2009-06-22 06:32:50.000000', NULL, 0),
