(5539805, 798962, 80096, '<td valign="top">All my artistic entries scored in the 4+ range too. It''s best to save these images for the sides where the criteria is not so stringent. Or perhaps take advantage of the unusual challenges like the latest ones.. Image Grainy and Never Seen on DPC.. these offer more flexibility as far as creativity is concerned. Nice attempt though on the statue, your processing effect is very unique and it''s exceptionally well done. I don''t feel the score reflects the true artistic ability inherent in this image.</td>', 'All my artistic entries scored in the 4+ range too. It''s best to save these images for the sides where the criteria is not so stringent. Or perhaps take advantage of the unusual challenges like the latest ones.. Image Grainy and Never Seen on DPC.. these offer more flexibility as far as creativity is concerned. Nice attempt though on the statue, your processing effect is very unique and it''s exceptionally well done. I don''t feel the score reflects the true artistic ability inherent in this image.', '2009-06-22 15:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
