(5542746, 799334, 22301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jumboshrimp:</b></div><hr/><i> what time of day was this taken (in relation to the sun being down, etc) - I LOVE IT!  the motion of the clouds makes it so much better to me... wow! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This was taken around 5 pm. The ND 110 filter is a ten stop Neutral Density filter, that makes a 1/30 exposure into a 30 sec exposure.</td>', 'Originally posted by jumboshrimp: what time of day was this taken (in relation to the sun being down, etc) - I LOVE IT!  the motion of the clouds makes it so much better to me... wow!  This was taken around 5 pm. The ND 110 filter is a ten stop Neutral Density filter, that makes a 1/30 exposure into a 30 sec exposure.', '2009-06-24 17:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
