(5636573, 798175, 68586, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100773" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">BJamy</a> that a hand written musical score may have added more depth and intimacy to this, I also wonder what this would look like with with just a hint of the colour returned to it. Again while I really like the crispness of the B&amp;W, it might just make it feel warmer with a hint of colour.<br/> <br/>Very nice shot though and undervalued at that score.</td>', 'Excellent shot - I agree with  BJamy that a hand written musical score may have added more depth and intimacy to this, I also wonder what this would look like with with just a hint of the colour returned to it. Again while I really like the crispness of the B&W, it might just make it feel warmer with a hint of colour. Very nice shot though and undervalued at that score.', '2009-09-05 04:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
